WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
LYNX extras are LYNX's own improvements, on top of how FL Studio works.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.600
Grouped by area: Mixer, Playlist, Piano roll and more. Each says what it does.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.600
Find one with Ctrl+F, here the loudness meter, and switch it on.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.600
The Mixer now shows the song's loudness beside the Master.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.400
Any time, you choose how much LYNX to have.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.200
FL-exact turns every extra off: LYNX then works exactly like FL Studio.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.200
Recommended turns on the ones that only help, and never change FL's keys or your files.
